Christ the King Preschool​at Second-Ponce A premier Catholic preschool in the heart of Buckhead emphasizing experiential learning in God’s beautiful outdoors.

About Us

Christ the King Preschool at Second-Ponce is a program of the Cathedral of Christ the King located on the campus of Second-Ponce de Leon Baptist Church. The Cathedral preschool provides half-day programs to students ages 1-Pre-K. We are also licensed by the Department of Early Care and Learning, which allows us to provide extended hours beyond the typical 3-4 hour preschool day.  As part of the Archdiocese of Atlanta, we operate under the guidelines and principles of the Office of Catholic Schools.

